# Multiple reggression analysis {style="color:white"}

```{r}


rosetta::regr(
    Intentie ~
      Attitude_Agg+
      Gedragscontrole_Agg + 
      Norm_Agg,
    collinearity = TRUE,
  data=Clean_data_16_40
);
```

